  "body": "I want to avoid fullscreen elements covering anything else in the top layer, e.g. dialog.\r\n\r\nI don't think it is necessary to be a common rule in the top layer system. I believe it makes sense to have dialog on top of fullscreen element, but not versa vice.\r\n\r\nBTW, I don't think I mentioned anything about the hierarchy requirement in my last comment. I just said the topmost element in the top layer must have fullscreen flag set.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @upsuper in https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/6#issuecomment-120889973_",
